</mxCell><mxCell id="c97" value="Solid line: association between the actor and a use case.&lt;br&gt;Hollow-triangle arrow: generalisation – each detailed report (Rxx) is a specialised form of its parent use case.&lt;br&gt;For R04–R06, R12–R16 and R20–R22, N is supplied by the user at runtime (command-line input, default 5) and is not hard-coded." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontStyle=2;fontSize=10;fontColor=#5F6976;spacingLeft=0;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="250" y="1984" width="765" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>